  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Back when the new Main Menu was being tested in Beta, I reorganized a bunch of worlds around from one playlist to another while on the Beta branch. This caused a strange bit of desync between how the world playlists showed up between the in-game order and the website playlist order.\nNow that the website allowed for reorganizing, the worlds are sort of \"stuck\" in this desynced state where what's listed as the 4th playlist on the website shows up as the third listed playlist in-game. Moving them around or renaming them on either the website or in-game keeps them from being properly synced up in terms of their display order. \nIs there any way to get these back into a synced order, or are my playlists stuck in this desynced state because I fiddled around with organizing worlds back when the new Main Menu was still in beta?",
